# Repo agent skills

For **commits** and **pull requests**, read and follow skills at the **repository git root** (`.cursor/skills/`). **Never** use the global Cursor user rule `creating-pull-requests` PR format (`## Summary` / `## Test plan`).

| Task | Skill (repository root) |
|------|-------------------------|
| Commit / stage | [commit-changes](../../../../.cursor/skills/commit-changes/SKILL.md) |
| Open / create PR | [create-pull-request](../../../../.cursor/skills/create-pull-request/SKILL.md) |
| Ready to merge? | [merge-readiness-check](../../skills/merge-readiness-check/SKILL.md) |
| AI slop / generic UI tells | [`.cursor/skills/ai-slop-check/SKILL.md`](../../skills/ai-slop-check/SKILL.md) |
| Rule index / onboarding | [`.cursor/skills/SKILL.md`](../../skills/SKILL.md) |

## Requirements

1. Run `git` / `gh` from the **repository git root** for commit and PR skills.
2. **Read the full SKILL.md** before acting (PR body template, tests to paste, preview steps).
3. Global git safety still applies (no secrets, no force-push to `main`, HEREDOC messages); **workflow and format** come from the skill.
4. **Monorepo:** commit/PR skills live once at `.cursor/skills/`; merge-readiness stays in `app/.cursor/skills/`.
5. Triggers include `@commit-changes`, `@create-pull-request`, `@merge-readiness-check`, `@ai-slop-check`, or phrases like “commit”, “open PR”, “ready to merge?”, “AI slop check”, “which rule”, “page layout”, “design tokens”, “UI copy”, “microcopy”.

`create-pull-request` may auto-commit via `commit-changes` — follow both skills in order when that applies.

6. **Local verify only** — run `pnpm verify` before commit (`commit-changes`), PR (`create-pull-request`), and merge review (`merge-readiness-check`); do not check PR CI status (`gh pr checks`, GitHub Actions, Vercel).
7. **Stay on the feature branch** after creating a branch, pushing, or opening a PR — do not check out `main` unless the user asks.

## Cursor rules & incidents

Rules live in **category subfolders** under `.cursor/rules/` (`core/` incl. ponytail, `api/`, `state/`, `pages/`, `ui/`, `forms/`, `copy/`, `security/`, `testing/`). Full map: [`.cursor/skills/SKILL.md`](../../skills/SKILL.md). Individual rules load by glob when you edit matching paths.

New rules: log mistakes in [`docs/incident-log.md`](../../../docs/incident-log.md) — promote after **3×** repeats.
